        "suspected_behavior": "reserve now mutates the caller's stock dict in place instead of returning a copy, so reusing the stock dict sees depleted quantity",
        "expected_base": "reserve({'A': 10}, 'A', 2) returns {'A': 8} and the caller-owned input dict stays {'A': 10}; a second call with the same input dict also returns {'A': 8}, and `result is stock` is False",
